HPE VM ESSENTIALS (VME) 8.1.2 - CLI NETWORKING: CREATION, MAPPING & DIAGNOSTICS
========================================================================================================================

1. STEP-BY-STEP COMPUTE NETWORK CREATION VIA CLI (KVM / OVS Layer)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 1: Create a temporary KVM Network XML Definition file (e.g., /tmp/compute-vlan100.xml) using Notepad layout:
        <network>
          <name>compute-vlan100</name>
          <forward mode='bridge'/>
          <bridge name='br-compute'/>
          <vlan trunk='yes'>
            <tag id='100'/>
          </vlan>
          <virtualport type='openvswitch'/>
        </network>

STEP 2: Import, initialize, and lock the network definition into the hypervisor:
        sudo virsh net-define /tmp/compute-vlan100.xml
        sudo virsh net-start compute-vlan100
        sudo virsh net-autostart compute-vlan100

